            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[A chat that hits its account's limit moves to your next account with room again when it was running subagents. Their notices, written after Claude's limit message, made Séance think you had replied, so the chat stayed on the full account until you typed something yourself.

A Fable chat now counts another account's used-up Fable allowance as full, so it no longer moves there only to stop again, and the note on the chat names the Fable limit.
]]></description>
